flowchart TB
    %% QUALTAN Modern Architecture and Controlled Workflow
    Operator([QA Engineer / CI / IDE User])

    subgraph Entry[Operator and Interoperability Layer]
        CLI[Click CLI<br/>full-cycle • approval • evaluation • knowledge]
        MCP[Governed MCP Server<br/>narrow typed tools]
        Legacy[Legacy Agent Facades<br/>compatible command interfaces]
    end

    subgraph Sources[Approved Inputs and Evidence]
        Jira[Jira Story / Acceptance Criteria]
        Specs[OpenAPI / GraphQL / UI Test Intent]
        Knowledge[Approved Quality Knowledge<br/>patterns • policies • prior evidence]
        Evidence[Failure Evidence<br/>trace • DOM • accessibility • network • screenshot]
    end

    subgraph Controls[Security, Policy, and Data Controls]
        Config[Typed Settings<br/>environment configuration]
        Redaction[Sensitive Data Redactor]
        Policy[Execution and Mutation Policy<br/>host allowlist • safe commands • approvals]
        Approval[Human Approval Gate]
    end

    subgraph Core[QUALTAN Application and Domain Layer]
        Workflow[Durable QualityWorkflow<br/>checkpointed state machine]
        Domain[Strict Pydantic Domain Contracts<br/>QualityWorkItem and typed artifacts]
        Req[Requirement Analysis Service]
        Design[Test Design Service<br/>risk-based and evidence-grounded]
        Code[Test Code Generation Service]
        Diagnose[Failure Diagnosis Service<br/>review-required patch proposals]
        Other[Data • Security • Performance • Reporting Services]
    end

    subgraph AI[AI and Retrieval Boundary]
        Gateway[Central LLM Gateway<br/>routing • JSON Schema • retries • cache]
        Models[(Approved Model Providers)]
        Retrieval[Permission-filtered Knowledge Store<br/>scope-aware lexical retrieval]
    end

    subgraph Assurance[Deterministic Assurance Layer]
        Validators[Validation Pipeline]
        V1[Schema and Integrity Gate]
        V2[Acceptance-Criteria Coverage Gate]
        V3[Generated Source Safety Gate]
        V4[Isolated TypeScript Compile Gate]
        Evals[Evaluation Graders<br/>coverage • safety • completion]
    end

    subgraph Persistence[Durable State, Evidence, and Telemetry]
        Artifacts[(Artifact Store<br/>atomic JSON work items and evidence)]
        Telemetry[(JSONL Telemetry<br/>task • model • latency • tokens)]
    end

    subgraph External[Governed Execution and Integrations]
        Runner[Policy-Governed Test Runner]
        Playwright[Playwright / Locust Execution]
        JiraAPI[Jira Gateway]
        Xray[X-Ray Gateway<br/>mutations require enablement and approval]
        Repo[Repository / PR Boundary<br/>future approved write path]
    end

    subgraph Delivery[Delivery and Quality Feedback]
        Report[Executive Report and Evidence Summary]
        CI[GitHub Actions<br/>tests • smoke checks • artifacts]
    end

    Operator --> CLI
    Operator --> MCP
    Operator --> Legacy
    CLI --> Workflow
    MCP --> Workflow
    Legacy --> Req
    Legacy --> Design
    Legacy --> Code
    Legacy --> Other

    Jira --> JiraAPI --> Workflow
    Specs --> Workflow
    Knowledge --> Retrieval
    Evidence --> Redaction --> Diagnose

    Config --> Gateway
    Config --> Policy
    Redaction --> Gateway
    Policy --> Approval

    Workflow <--> Domain
    Workflow --> Req --> Gateway
    Workflow --> Design
    Design <--> Retrieval
    Design --> Gateway
    Workflow --> Code --> Gateway
    Diagnose --> Gateway
    Other --> Gateway
    Gateway <--> Models
    Gateway --> Telemetry

    Workflow --> Artifacts
    Retrieval <--> Artifacts
    Diagnose --> Artifacts
    Workflow --> Approval
    Approval -- approved --> Validators
    Approval -- rejected --> Artifacts
    Workflow --> Validators
    Validators --> V1
    Validators --> V2
    Validators --> V3
    Validators --> V4
    Validators --> Artifacts
    Validators --> Evals
    Evals --> Artifacts

    Policy --> Runner --> Playwright
    Playwright --> Evidence
    Runner --> Artifacts
    Policy --> Xray
    Policy --> Repo
    Workflow --> JiraAPI
    Workflow --> Xray

    Artifacts --> Report
    Evals --> Report
    Report --> Operator
    CI --> Validators
    CI --> Playwright
    CI --> Artifacts

